emsa-cv:7ddc91f5-a5f0-5f3e-b18a-5b693d7100db prez:description "Slope descriptor representing a slope angle in the range from between 0°36' - 1°45' degree." ;
	prez:label "Very gently inclined" .

emsa-cv:97d1820d-545f-5694-b379-9f360b8d123b prez:description "Refers to the NVIS dominant vegetation structural formation class, with a percent cover of about <0.25% of shrubs including cycads, grass-tree and tree-fern. " ;
