emsa-cv:436e8a65-505a-505b-811e-c6be4e4ae651 prez:description "Adult- refers to a maturity quality of an individual by virtue of the individual having attained sexual maturity and full growth. Also defined as, an adult is a plant, animal or person who has reached full growth or alternatively is capable of reproduction." ;
	prez:label "adult" .

geo:FeatureCollection prez:description "The class Feature Collection represents any collection of individual Features."@en ;
	prez:label "Feature Collection"@en .

emsa-cv:2d997343-4be2-411a-944a-7ef956e696a2 prez:label "erect" .

tern-cv:ae71c3f6-d430-400f-a1d4-97a333b4ee02 prez:description "Collection of individuals belonging to the same species, living in the same area (Silvertown and Charlesworth 2001). In practice, the focal set of individuals and the spatial scale of the populations has to be define.", "Group of individuals of the same plant species living within a given area." ;
	prez:label "plant population"@en .

